### Register User

POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "agung",
  "username": "agung",
  "password": "rahasia"
}

### Login User
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "agung",
  "password": "rahasia"
}

